   "design": "Team decisions are entered once in the record's meeting module, which writes each decision to the patient's record, instead of a paper list copied record by record. Tests and appointments at other departments are requested electronically from the record. A team worklist shows open actions per patient, so checking patient by patient and the spreadsheet drop. Meetings, rounds, reading notes, writing decisions and team messages stay with the neurologist.",
   "approvals": [],
